{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Not Guilty! is a crazy mix of detective work, prison management, and absurd executions.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the warden of the most disastrous prison in town! Earn a triple salary: manage the prison, deliver court verdicts, and carry out the sentences \u2014 whether it\u2019s life imprisonment or a torturous execution. Your superiors expect total obedience to protocol, a perfectly maintained facility, and as few acquittals as possible...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSCIENCE VS PROFIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Is the prison budget barely enough to wipe with? Take bribes, promote nepotism, and extend sentences by tampering with evidence and testimonies. Don\u2019t spare the old lady in the electric chair, the mafia boss has a family too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECTACULAR EXECUTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your boss is a real bastard who pays extra for prisoners\u2019 suffering. Put on a real show by unlocking new execution methods and buying upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PRISON HAS A LIMIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Five inmates and only one free bunk? Simple \u2014 KILL FOUR. Or expand and renovate the building! Don\u2019t be cheap: neglect the prison and the inmates will riot and throw something at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your full job instructions will be waiting at your workplace. Shift starts at 7 a.m. No being late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your probation period starts NOW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters who practically beg for the guillotine. Who hasn\u2019t dreamt of murdering that acquaintance who invested in bitcoin at the right moment?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging detective work. Untangle a case, then twist it in whatever way benefits you. Execution methods with upgrades and dramatic flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected twists. Prison changes people, and people change the prison. Keep an eye on it through the cameras! Economy vs ethics: you decide what\u2019s worth more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A secret ending. Take revenge on your boss \u2014 for yourself and for others!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776810?t=1772472634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776810?t=1772472634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/50483f4008526a39e4733aa3c2e2c21aad39330e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772472634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/50483f4008526a39e4733aa3c2e2c21aad39330e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772472634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains fictional execution scenes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Not Guilty! is a crazy mix of detective work, prison management, and absurd executions.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the warden of the most disastrous prison in town! Earn a triple salary: manage the prison, deliver court verdicts, and carry out the sentences \u2014 whether it\u2019s life imprisonment or a torturous execution. Your superiors expect total obedience to protocol, a perfectly maintained facility, and as few acquittals as possible...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSCIENCE VS PROFIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/6ca561e030e45ce7c153f7d80d145a95.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Is the prison budget barely enough to wipe with? Take bribes, promote nepotism, and extend sentences by tampering with evidence and testimonies. Don\u2019t spare the old lady in the electric chair, the mafia boss has a family too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECTACULAR EXECUTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/1c429058badb1a2dfddcc534d6eaf229.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your boss is a real bastard who pays extra for prisoners\u2019 suffering. Put on a real show by unlocking new execution methods and buying upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PRISON HAS A LIMIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/9136a19c74710d78894d1a3a19b60e28.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Five inmates and only one free bunk? Simple \u2014 KILL FOUR. Or expand and renovate the building! Don\u2019t be cheap: neglect the prison and the inmates will riot and throw something at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your full job instructions will be waiting at your workplace. Shift starts at 7 a.m. No being late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your probation period starts NOW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.poster.avif?t=1772472634\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.webm?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/c64dbaf094f4536b3c0cd2b39f489050.mp4?t=1772472634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters who practically beg for the guillotine. Who hasn\u2019t dreamt of murdering that acquaintance who invested in bitcoin at the right moment?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging detective work. Untangle a case, then twist it in whatever way benefits you. Execution methods with upgrades and dramatic flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected twists. Prison changes people, and people change the prison. Keep an eye on it through the cameras! Economy vs ethics: you decide what\u2019s worth more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A secret ending. Take revenge on your boss \u2014 for yourself and for others!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Panacota Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/105b0114c6d374f0a08840d0c181f2699bbf8d1d/header.jpg?t=1772472634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3776810/460004636/7d83a5108602451e6b31b48b677f56ff4335adcf/1771228113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771230005","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3776810/460004636/7d83a5108602451e6b31b48b677f56ff4335adcf/1771228113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771230005","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3776810/460004636/7d83a5108602451e6b31b48b677f56ff4335adcf/1771228113/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771230005","id":257287998,"name":"Not Guilty!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257287998/215a20549ff23d78f0a4fe1ff8d2a79ace0afa4a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771230005"}],"name":"Not Guilty!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Athlon XP<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Panacota Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0",